WEBVTT

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.519
about how they feel
about a particular film.

00:13:00.519 --> 00:13:02.519
What can we do to make sure

00:13:02.519 --> 00:13:06.399
that all the disruptors, all the
minority voices in this organization,

00:13:06.399 --> 00:13:08.399
speak up and are heard?

00:13:08.399 --> 00:13:12.020
And, finally, let's bestow credit
in a very generous way."

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.320
I don't know if you've ever looked
at the credits of a Pixar movie,

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.480
but the babies born during
a production are listed there.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.879
(Laughter)

00:13:19.879 --> 00:13:22.879
How did Bill think about
what his role was?

00:13:22.879 --> 00:13:26.360
Bill said, "I lead
a volunteer organization.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:30.120
Talented people don't want
to follow me anywhere.